{"name":"Cake Pop","hex":"#edc9d0","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"cake pop","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A confection consisting of a round piece of cake coated in icing or chocolate and stuck on a stick in the manner of a lollipop."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/cake_pop"}],"entries":[{"title":"Cake Pop","blocks":[{"text":"Cake Pop is an American experimental pop band pioneered by Dylan Brady. Other members of the group include Ravenna Golden, Cali Cartier, Lewis Grant, Kevin Bedford, Pritty, Adam Newcomer, and Robel Ketema."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cake_Pop"},{"title":"Cake pop","blocks":[{"text":"A cake pop is a form of cake styled as a lollipop. Cake crumbs are mixed until bound together, sometimes using icing or chocolate, and formed into small spheres or cubes in the same way as cake balls, before being given a coating of icing, chocolate or other decorations and attached to lollipop sticks. Cake pops can be a way of using up leftover cake or cake crumbs."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c4/Chocolate_cake_pops.jpg/330px-Chocolate_cake_pops.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cake_pop"},{"title":"Cake","blocks":[{"text":"Cake is a baker's confectionery made by combining flour with a liquid, a fat or both, and usually with a leavening agent. Cakes are usually baked, but can be griddled. In their oldest forms, cakes were modifications of bread, but cakes now cover a wide range of preparations that can be simple or elaborate and which share features with other desserts such as pastries, meringues, custards, and pies."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/04/Pound_layer_cake.jpg/330px-Pound_layer_cake.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cake"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/7b/Bartolom%C3%A9_Esteban_Perez_Murillo_-_Baking_of_Flat_Cakes_-_WGA16350.jpg/500px-Bartolom%C3%A9_Esteban_Perez_Murillo_-_Baking_of_Flat_Cakes_-_WGA16350.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/7b/Bartolom%C3%A9_Esteban_Perez_Murillo_-_Baking_of_Flat_Cakes_-_WGA16350.jpg/500px-Bartolom%C3%A9_Esteban_Perez_Murillo_-_Baking_of_Flat_Cakes_-_WGA16350.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Baking of Flat Cakes by the Spanish painter Bartolomé Esteban Murillo, c. 1650","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ABartolom%C3%A9_Esteban_Perez_Murillo_-_Baking_of_Flat_Cakes_-_WGA16350.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f5/Cake_mix_in_plastic_packet_photo.JPG/500px-Cake_mix_in_plastic_packet_photo.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f5/Cake_mix_in_plastic_packet_photo.JPG/500px-Cake_mix_in_plastic_packet_photo.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Chocolate cake mix in plastic packets","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ACake_mix_in_plastic_packet_photo.JPG"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/88/182365_Gooey_Butter_Cake.jpg/500px-182365_Gooey_Butter_Cake.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/88/182365_Gooey_Butter_Cake.jpg/1280px-182365_Gooey_Butter_Cake.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/88/182365_Gooey_Butter_Cake.jpg/500px-182365_Gooey_Butter_Cake.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Butter cake with powdered sugar","link":"https://en.wiki